    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐφορ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to bear double,</i> esp. of fruit, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.14.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be spelt</i> or <i>pronounced in two ways,</i>
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.543
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				197
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				51
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφορούμενος δυλλογισμός</span> syllogism
			with an identical proposition as premise, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.87
			</span></i>, al.</div>
